<h2>Executive Summary & Technical Scope</h2>

<p>This laboratory investigation evaluates the thermodynamic efficiency, overall heat transfer coefficient ($U$), and fluid dynamics performance across concentric tube and shell-and-tube heat exchanger configurations under counter-current and co-current flow dynamics.</p>

